  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-11T12:39:14.707827Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T14:09:19.502046Z",
  "totalBlocks": 106,
  "translatedBlocks": 103,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4a550702cd40dfe",
      "translationZh": "⭐ 在 GitHub 上为 ScarfBench 点亮 Star",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7719a03ca0feced",
      "translationZh": "企业应用现代化是组织开展的规模最大、成本最高的软件工程活动之一。团队将应用从一个框架迁移到另一个框架，以提升可维护性、云就绪程度、开发者生产力，以及对现代功能的获取能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7db829c5fcb1cfcc",
      "translationZh": "编程智能体的近期进展激发了人们对 AI 辅助现代化的热情。但一个重要问题仍然存在：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca1dc05cee25b4e4",
      "translationZh": "AI 智能体能否可靠地将现实世界中的企业应用现代化？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f14f4675f6af2b9",
      "translationZh": "现有的软件工程基准测试在错误修复和代码生成方面展现了令人瞩目的进展，但框架迁移带来的挑战在本质上有所不同。要取得成功，不仅需要转换代码，还需要保持行为不变、适配构建系统，并妥善处理运行时依赖。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bcb171077fbf46c",
      "translationZh": "为填补这一空白，我们推出了 ScarfBench（Self-Contained Application Refactoring Benchmark，自包含应用重构基准），这是一个用于评估 AI 智能体在企业级 Java 跨框架迁移任务中表现的开放基准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f629349e08832faa",
      "translationZh": "ScarfBench 专注于三大 Java 生态系统之间的迁移：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db29e82a9287fc28",
      "translationZh": "春季",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d97de6fb562d042",
      "translationZh": "与将生成的代码同参考实现进行比较的传统基准测试不同，ScarfBench 评估的是迁移后的应用是否确实能够构建、部署并保持原有行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "273df451c23c8c3f",
      "translationZh": "迁移为何困难",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0914c2f494accac",
      "translationZh": "框架迁移远不止替换注解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b63a62b850f6e",
      "translationZh": "一次简单的仓储迁移可能需要修改依赖注入、持久化配置、查询和框架描述符中的多个部分。其中任何一个部分的小错误都可能导致部署失败。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0c752c4217ba124",
      "translationZh": "图：Spring → Jakarta 迁移示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bea441ff2dd51871",
      "translationZh": "框架迁移需要转换框架语义，而不只是转换源代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4b42ff1653a65e3e",
      "translationZh": "ScarfBench 简介",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3332432b71f82850",
      "translationZh": "ScarfBench 提供了一种系统化的方法，用于评估 AI 智能体在企业级 Java 框架迁移任务中的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0e436b005e3b215",
      "translationZh": "应用程序必须满足以下要求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb46bef1c7c29a66",
      "translationZh": "成功构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d36d1117686440c",
      "translationZh": "正确部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c61c0afe85ffa55",
      "translationZh": "通过行为验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2052ee9e1c0a1bef",
      "translationZh": "这为现代化改造的质量提供了一种更贴近实际的衡量方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ab2391e55278adc7",
      "translationZh": "基准测试概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d275a74912cca2e",
      "translationZh": "指标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e37953d23daca5f",
      "translationZh": "数值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98e33b0f3104fcf1",
      "translationZh": "应用程序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5ab484c0b6eb2c1",
      "translationZh": "框架实现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a692427ae797cc5",
      "translationZh": "迁移任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdcc043d3d050bb1",
      "translationZh": "代码行数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b796e7cc4a5acfeb",
      "translationZh": "源代码和测试文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5021d5681d978733",
      "translationZh": "专家编写的测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "012d73acf7b836e2",
      "translationZh": "ScarfBench 既包含针对性的迁移任务，也包含整个应用程序的迁移。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e63b9066f2208e8e",
      "translationZh": "图：ScarfBench 构建流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fc733b4671e76e2",
      "translationZh": "以基于 JSR 的企业级 Java 分类体系为起点，专家通过迁移，在 Spring、Jakarta EE 和 Quarkus 中创建经过验证的实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a8e1291cfbe56e6c",
      "translationZh": "前沿智能体表现如何？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54f19c8989a86790",
      "translationZh": "我们在 ScarfBench 上评估了多个当前最先进的编程智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35d575c46a805b03",
      "translationZh": "尽管在传统软件工程基准测试中表现出色，框架迁移仍然困难重重。不同框架组合之间的成功率差异很大，而整个应用程序的迁移仍然尤其具有挑战性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9aeb139898edd88",
      "translationZh": "图：当前排行榜",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b045434cf6ee7da4",
      "translationZh": "来源：scarfbench.info/leaderboard",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b065812ca92fd8a5",
      "translationZh": "即使是当前最强的智能体，行为验证成功率也低于 10%，这表明生成可编译代码与保持应用行为之间存在差距。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0da1a4f33ccb5cb7",
      "translationZh": "图：编译 → 部署 → 测试的阶段进展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2352cb71cfe5541b",
      "translationZh": "编译成功率始终高于部署成功率，而部署成功率又高于行为验证成功率。仅凭构建成功来衡量，会显著高估迁移质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a05b3444c016ee09",
      "translationZh": "图：按目标框架划分的迁移结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00d74101afa4b5b2",
      "translationZh": "迁移难度在很大程度上取决于目标框架，其中 Jakarta EE 尤其具有挑战性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8c8ce091a7b45a39",
      "translationZh": "关于用于 Java 现代化改造的 AI 智能体，我们有哪些发现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c62a40dbd0ca36a",
      "translationZh": "除了衡量成功率，ScarfBench 还帮助我们了解智能体在现代化改造过程中的行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b42bc2935b81913",
      "translationZh": "智能体能可靠地判断迁移何时完成吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71aa1537a7d2d51c",
      "translationZh": "迁移后的应用只有真正能够构建并运行，才有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3f155a126298fb8",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们将智能体报告的结果与独立的构建验证结果进行了比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f087b7196eb6dcbf",
      "translationZh": "发现：智能体过于自信",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e72cc7ca1781a21",
      "translationZh": "Claude Code 报告称，30 个完整应用中有 29 个构建成功。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e636a93a8a762bd9",
      "translationZh": "这些应用中，实际构建成功的只有 22 个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9453e3c44c0dc5ec",
      "translationZh": "与此同时，唯一被智能体判定为失败的应用，最终却正确完成了构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff9f80b04f76f2eb",
      "translationZh": "这表明，不应将智能体的自我评估视为迁移完成的可靠信号。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9c9c01e979f5820",
      "translationZh": "独立进行构建和测试验证仍然至关重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b640bfc4de0ddf7b",
      "translationZh": "智能体如何处理应用程序的依赖关系？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f2efdfb1c2eea26",
      "translationZh": "框架迁移很少只影响单个文件或单个层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf85014b2ad00ece",
      "translationZh": "配置、服务、数据库和 Web 组件的变更往往会在整个应用程序中引发连锁影响。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9022d3b42a38c82a",
      "translationZh": "发现：迁移是迭代过程，而非线性过程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eeb67884eee79948",
      "translationZh": "最常访问的层包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b332c3492d5eb10a",
      "translationZh": "配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2975104784a401e3",
      "translationZh": "万维网",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa7fe67124e94375",
      "translationZh": "数据库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d677190e0a9990e7",
      "translationZh": "服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05154930b0a698d5",
      "translationZh": "常见的切换包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de34500ceaa0162e",
      "translationZh": "配置 ↔ Web",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55ca16c7c8e7a89e",
      "translationZh": "服务 ↔ 数据库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1dcb5439a80c6ea",
      "translationZh": "这表明，迁移是一个迭代式的依赖关系解析过程，而非简单的源代码到源代码转换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c8736df28e20b037",
      "translationZh": "智能体把大部分精力花在了哪里？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90a81d9582397203",
      "translationZh": "我们使用各层的重复访问频率作为衡量迁移工作量的替代指标。需要反复访问的层通常涉及调试、依赖关系解析或框架适配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb28eb2afadc5890",
      "translationZh": "发现：配置占据迁移工作的主要部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38aae8934315fde2",
      "translationZh": "智能体并未按线性流程推进，而是在解决框架差异和依赖问题时，反复回到与配置相关的产物上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5b0792381d382e3b",
      "translationZh": "哪些挑战与代码转换无关？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01e7a39a98ba4f5a",
      "translationZh": "并非所有迁移问题都源自源代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "051f9a1167bbb5f5",
      "translationZh": "发现：环境和工具很重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "846a5db58df7213b",
      "translationZh": "智能体经常难以应对环境问题，包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b1bc21deaf71362",
      "translationZh": "Docker 缓存不一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a32ed9da7708676b",
      "translationZh": "端口连接问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38a7be7d341f094e",
      "translationZh": "Maven wrapper 和构建工具问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9668ee2ee27fc885",
      "translationZh": "即使源代码迁移本身已基本完成，这些运维方面的问题也常常会延误验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "897b2ff8dd195361",
      "translationZh": "图：失败模式分布",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91d52edaa470683e",
      "translationZh": "现代化改造中的失败涉及构建系统、部署环境、依赖注入、数据库、端点、断言和基础设施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b02a732edcff69db",
      "translationZh": "核心要点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9f5530112b47bd5",
      "translationZh": "框架现代化改造中最大的挑战并不是转换 Java 代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecf3a1ee89242413",
      "translationZh": "而是管理横跨配置、基础设施和运行时环境的依赖关系网络。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba2ea8fa3dff24a3",
      "translationZh": "尽管前沿智能体能够自动完成迁移过程中的相当一部分工作，但可靠的验证和架构推理仍是取得成功的关键。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96a24f4f0f3f160b",
      "translationZh": "ScarfBench 有助于揭示这些挑战，并提供一种标准化方法，用于衡量迈向真正自主的应用现代化的进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d19ea0f6de48cfde",
      "translationZh": "探索 ScarfBench",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96e98f000f60cbda",
      "translationZh": "ScarfBench 旨在成为面向研究人员和实践者的开放资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "beae86abeea26316",
      "translationZh": "资源包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
